      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate reported a gross prior year reserve strengthening of GBP 166.464 million in 2024. This adverse development was primarily driven by reserve deteriorations on prior year losses, including increased provisions for potential exposures arising from the Russian invasion of Ukraine within the Aviation and Marine & Energy divisions, as well as adverse developments on the prior years of account within Aerospace and Excess Liability. Catastrophe losses such as the Baltimore Bridge Collapse and Hurricanes Milton and Helene also impacted closed years of account. Partially offsetting these strengthenings were favourable reserve releases on prior year catastrophe losses related to Hurricanes Otis, Ian, and Idalia in the Property & Motor division.",
